TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium in pure water, fixed O2(g)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite  0    0.1
    Goethite 0 0
    Gypsum   0 0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings S6_molal
    10 PUNCH TOT("S(6)")
END
